{"articleNo":"2770","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2770&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"교내 성적장학생 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.02.25","hit":"15443","attachments":[{"name":"장학금지급지침(13차개정-최종)1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2770&attachNo=2639"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"left\"><font size=\"4\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n</font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><font size=\"4\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&lt;&nbsp;교내성적장학생 선발 안내 &gt;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;\n</span></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"4\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><span style=\"Z-INDEX: -1; POSITION: absolute\"><strong><img height=\"92\" alt=\"\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/user/LOCALS~1/Temp/UNI00000cb825c9.gif\" width=\"570\" border=\"0\"></strong></span></span></font></p><font size=\"4\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">※ 성<!--StartFragment--></font></font></strong><strong><font color=\"#ff0000\" size=\"4\">적<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴바탕’\"></span><!--StartFragment-->장학생(금오, 우등, 준우등)은 공인 외국어 성적표를 반드시 제출<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 하여야 장학금 수혜 대상자로 선정될 수 있습니다.</font><br><br></strong></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong>&nbsp;1) 금오 및 우등장학금</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;금오 및 우등장학생은 직전학기 성적과 학년별 최저 공인 외국어 시험성적을 </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong>다음과 같이 적용한다.</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 36.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;∘ 2011학년도 1학기 기준으로 2학년 500점, 3학년 550점, 4학년 600점이상 취득한 자.</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 36.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;∘ 2011학년도 1학기 기준으로 1학년만 공인 외국어 성적을 반영하지 않는다.</strong></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong>&nbsp;2) 준우등장학금 </strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">∘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">준우등장학생은 직전학기성적 70%+공인 외국어 성적 30%를 환산하여 합산 한다.</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">∘2011년 1학기 기준으로 2학년은 모의토익 시험성적을 인정한다.</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><strong>&nbsp;3) 공인외국어 시험성적 적용기준은 해당학기 시작일(6.1, 12.1)부터 1년이내의&nbsp;<br>공인</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><strong>외국어 시험성적표을 제출하여야 한다.</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2011년 1학기 성적장학금은 2009. 12. 01 ~ 2010. 11. 30이내의 성적을 기준으로 한다.&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><strong><br></strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><strong>&nbsp;- 문의 : 054-478-7065 (학생처 본관101호)</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><strong>&nbsp;붙임&nbsp; 장학금 지급지침 1부.&nbsp; 끝.</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41.9pt\" align=\"center\"><br><br><font face=\"굴림\"><font size=\"5\">2011. 02. 25<br><br>학생처</font></font></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p align=\"left\"><br>&nbsp;</p>\n</font><p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
